OL,3,GNEWSAInfluencer's ex-partner guilty of
OL,4,Aracial abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former partner of a pro-Donald
OL,7,FTrump social media influencer has been
OL,8,Ffound guilty of racially abusing two
OL,9,Fsisters and threatening them with what
OL,10,Fhe claimed to be pepper spray outside a
OL,11,FLondon Tube station.
OL,13,FPhilipp Ostermann, 38, was convicted of
OL,14,Ftwo counts of causing racially
OL,15,Faggravated harassment and one count of
OL,16,Fusing threatening or abusive or
OL,17,Finsulting words or behaviour at City of
OL,18,FLondon Magistrates' Court.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
