OL,3,GNEWSAInfluencer's ex-partner guilty of
OL,4,Aracial abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe confrontation with Sabba and Marium
OL,7,FJaved near Bond Street station on 11
OL,8,FOctober 2025 left one of the sisters
OL,9,Ffeeling she was "not welcome in my
OL,10,Fhome", the court heard.
OL,12,FOstermann was spared a community order
OL,13,Fbecause he lives abroad but was fined
OL,14,F#2,000 for each offence.
